                "A tightly slash-separated entrance-exit result with a score must still route the record button to clear review.");
            Require(
                InvokeRuntimeUiLabel("BuildLobbyRecordButtonLabel", "탈출 완료 [A] 980점 / 64.0m / 콤7") == "클리어 복기",
