                "A zero-miss cap must advance into a clean-section goal instead of repeating itself.");
            Require(
                InvokeMockBackendStaticLabel(
                    "BuildAdvancedReviewTargetText",
                    "다음 구간 무실수 / 직전 2 / 달성 무실수",
